        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Weajoocheanda leabu wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanda hidu heeda Yeremiya bea fuga sean bea Yuda, aba jeeda gweaydeaba ang'wan bea gheambalmeeda Yehoyakimu orjeeda Yosiya was sugoocheanda Yuda (nea abeeda ea gweayda madeeda gil bea Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "damanda rukusa sibaneeda was Yeremiya fuga sean bea Yuda ea fuga abiita Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gweanyeew diktam ea samwagu, gidang'eada gweaydeaba damasamwagu bea gheambalmeeda Yosiya orjeeda Amoni, sugoocheanda Yuda, ea ghoah ghamneawa, gicha gabiigu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heedeanyu, ak gearukuneegwa galeagasean, ak agooga ea mooleeysiini iita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga ea mooleeysiini iit nea ea mooduupi, earapeadi NG'UTAMIIDA ajeaku galeagasean giijasoodigaaschi was sibanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayeena, ‘Daba siisi yamna geaw aba jeeda naweadingaaschi munyas ea sinaweagaaschi munyas, ak abeeda gajanyas giibinda jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi nigooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA, agooga sea ghweanigeagwa aba garayi ak gayghoah deang'wa ghang'eada garayi ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adiidu gooweayi aghadoawana nea googadiyeesi aseecheeka suuk, nea adiidu ghoanyareaschaani aba haleanjeeda oosini geatingeagwa. Ak abeeda ea maydaminighiseegwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, agooga mooleeysean iit, ng'ata hean ghoanyareaschaani aba gadiyoojiga oosini geatingeagwa, hean ghoahaaji geat minighista.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega: “Aba gideaba mii asisiina mureeda ng'asheegeasu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ula gaydeajeagu eemoojiga mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, ea Nebukadinesa siideanyu bea gadiyeeda was sugoocheanda Babeli, hean gaydanung' ghapka gang'uchi ng'eanyiini ea fuga abiita jeeda, ea eemooji ascheayi sea saawa; hean gaydahuuyda goosha, ak gaydanung' ghoah gichea easit, nea geemachiida, nea geefool damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydahuuyda aba jeeda nyaawa giijuureanda rearga ea giijuureanda hooseaneega, ea hooseaneega siyeeda ea gea sibeeda, ea nyeashta lagheaneeda sing'ealiida ea gheaboong'nyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiini gayghoah raghoonyeanda, ak eemoojisu gaygagadiyeesa sugoocheanda Babeli aba gweanyeew laadam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Nea iing'ata gweanyeew laadam ea damanamughuush, abeeda gaydaaga ghoorjooda sugoocheanda Babeli ea eemeedida, ea ng'eanyiida fuga Galdayo, aba munyasnacheeka nyaawa, ak gaydanung' ghoah ng'eanyiida gida marachi gil damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeadu badaydeaba ng'eanyiita ng'asheega sean ghayi eargu, ea ng'asheega sean sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaaboani, ghayi ramoorasa Yeremiya badayda eemoojiga sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eemoojiga sean ea sugoodiga hees gayghoah soomjooga; ak gaydawalda aba giteena sinaweega nyaawa ea gadiyoojiga geatinga nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda ASEETA aba badayda eemoojiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli: “Geandeawana geatindeanyu gikoombeeyda difaayi was nyarasta, ak giileaydi eemoojiga ghayi eajeakseeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaygwaleeyshi, ak geanung' gwaneayi iheenga, ak gwarooda iheenga nyaawa aba ng'uta eajeaksi jeenyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geageandi gikoombeeyda mida geatinda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghaanung' ghwaleaydaawa eemoojiga sean ghayi ajeaksean NG'UTAMIIDA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda Yerusalemu ea mujiinajeega Yuda, ea sugoodigaaschi ea fuga hees, gaydanung' ghoah raghoonyeanda, ea gida marachi gil, ak geemachiida ea geemooriida ea ghoah ghamneawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eara Farao was sugoocheanda Misri, ea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ea fugaaschi hees, ea fugaaschi sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea rabasta sean mida bugusta nyaawa; ea sugoodiga sean bea ng'eanyiida Usi ea sugoodiga sean bea ng'eanyiida Filisti (was Ashkeloni, ea Gasa, ea Ekroni, ea easanga Ashdodi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Edomu, ea Moabu, ea orjooga Amoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea sugoodiga sean bea Diro, ea sugoodiga sean bea Sidoni, ea sugoodiga ghuuta basooda, mida giigheawda basooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea fuga Dedani, ea Deema, ea Busi, ea gea laja guchoojiga nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea sugoodiga sean bea Arabiya, ea sugoodiga sean bea eemoojiga guuyi abiita eeshtearajeanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea sugoodiga sean bea Simri, ea sugoodiga sean bea Elamu, ea sugoodiga sean bea Mediya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea sugoodiga sean bea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, gea neeki ea gea sheagi, nea gabatiisiindooschi, nea sugoodiga mida badayda ng'eanyiida. Aba iining'ata saawa hean abeeda gayghwaleaydaawa sugoocheanda Babeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak hean gajeeshiina saawa, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA fuga Israeli: Aleeysheena, ea aboogida ama ng'ata gookeeschi, hean ak goobeedeayi ea araanya ng'eedita aba ng'uta eajagu bugusteang'wa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:27"
          },
