              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ama inyas ghaheawa ghoang'waayi ak ghwaleayda gikoombeeyda mida geatingaagu, abeeda gajeeshiina, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega: Gajaleayda aba uurda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
