            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula gaydang'eat dasin gea munyas aba jeedeaba mujiineeda sing'assa gheawungeasu, iyoong'ulayi ghoamuuschi aghuuhana bayiiga? Agooga majoamuusa aghuuha, aba gideaba gaydajaksa ng'uta badayda fuga bea ng'eanyiida, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA lugweega.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        }
