          "text": "“Nea gea jea ghabwar NG'UTAMIIDA eaweedida gayghang'eada meatkweenagi bea ng'eanyiida ea gagul niirja. Nea majeeyeawda, ghana eamughuush ghana eebuy; gaygawuurji ng'ooyanga aba badayda ng'eanyiida.",
